    "main_topic": [
      {
        "h_title": "Thailand Officially Commences 2026 Tropical Fruit Season, Strategic Integration of Gastronomy Soft Power to Accelerate Grassroots Economic Growth",
        "main_title": "Thailand Officially Commences 2026 Tropical Fruit Season, Strategic Integration of Gastronomy Soft Power to Accelerate Grassroots Economic Growth",
        "author": null,
        "language": "en",
        "level": 1,
        "primary_content": [
          {
            "text": "Thailand has officially entered its most vital agricultural window, leveraging the May peak of Durian and Mangosteen to drive a high-value \"Food Soft Power\" strategy. Beyond being a top global exporter, the nation is rebranding its orchards as premium Agri-Tourism destinations, shifting from mass tourism to a \"Farm-to-Table\" experience that attracts high-spending global travelers directly to community sources.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "Under the direction of the Ministry of Commerce and the Ministry of Tourism, the focus has pivoted toward Premium Grade products with Geographical Indication (GI) and international certifications (GAP/GMP). By integrating these \"jewels of the tropics\" into Fine Dining menus and luxury fusion desserts, Thailand is solidifying its status as the world’s tropical fruit capital. This move creates significant emotional value, allowing \"meaningful travel\" to flourish in secondary provinces like Chanthaburi and Trat.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          },
          {
            "text": "The economic impact extends nationwide through advanced Traceability systems and digital pre-order platforms, ensuring Thailand maintains its #1 market share in key regions like China. This integration of creative economy, digital logistics, and sustainable agriculture not only boosts national GDP but also ensures direct income distribution to grassroots communities, establishing a stable and sustainable economic model for the future.",
            "url": null,
            "urls": null
          }
        ],
        "secondary_content": null,
        "table_content": null
      }
    ],
